    },
    {
     "text": "Later... or now?",
     "dir": "normal",
     "pitch": 1.0,
     "pause": 0.8
    },
    {
     "text": "Most people choose wrong. Every day. Without even noticing.",
     "dir": "calm",
     "pitch": -0.5,
     "pause": 0.7,
     "tag": "A4"
    },
    {
     "text": "And that's what makes it dangerous.",
